  "title": "Southern-Style Black-Eyed Peas",
  "description": "This Southern black-eyed peas recipe features an array of seasonings, such as cumin and crushed red pepper, with smoked ham hocks for extra flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "carina"
  ],
